;  @(#) TSMC 0.18UM ASSURA LVS/RC COMMAND FILE 
;  @(#) FOR TSMC 0.18 UM CMOS MIXED SIGNAL GENERAL PURPOSE II 1P6M SALICIDE 1.8V/3.3V SPICE MODELS 
;  @(#) SPICE MODEL DOCUMENT: T-018-CM-SP-007 V1.2 
;  @(#) COMMAND FILE DOCUMENT: T-018-CM-SP-007-U1 
;  @(#) COMMAND FILE VERSION: 1.2a 
;  @(#) COMMAND FILE DATE: 01/28/2013 
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;

;;  Sheet Resistance table for 018 process
    RVWO	=	440              ;;  NW resistor within OD 
    RVWR	=	927              ;;  NW resistor under STI 
    RVPR	=	321.8            ;;  P+Poly resistor w/o Silicide 
    RVNR	=	295.3            ;;  N+Poly resistor w/o Silicide 
    RVPD	=	140.6            ;;  P+Diff resistor w/o Silicide 
    RVND	=	61.6             ;;  N+Diff resistor w/o Silicide 
    RVPSS	=	7.90             ;;  P+Poly resistor w/i Silicide (Width<2um) 
    RVPSL	=	7.90             ;;  P+Poly resistor w/i Silicide (Width>=2um) 
    RVNSS	=	7.89             ;;  N+Poly resistor w/i Silicide (Width<2um) 
    RVNSL	=	7.89             ;;  N+Poly resistor w/i Silicide (Width>=2um) 
    RVPIS	=	7.76             ;;  P+Diff resistor w/i Silicide (Width<2um) 
    RVPIL	=	7.76             ;;  P+Diff resistor w/i Silicide (Width>=2um) 
    RVNIS	=	6.82             ;;  N+Diff resistor w/i Silicide (Width<2um) 
    RVNIL	=	6.82             ;;  N+Diff resistor w/i Silicide (Width>=2um) 
    RVLR	=	1037             ;;  High resistance poly resistor
    RVM1	=	0.078            ;;  Metal-1  resistor 
    RVM2	=	0.078            ;;  Metal-2  resistor 
    RVM3	=	0.078            ;;  Metal-3  resistor 
    RVM4	=	0.078            ;;  Metal-4  resistor 
    RVM5	=	0.078            ;;  Metal-5  resistor 
    RV8k	=	0.036            ;;  8k  Top Metal resistor 
    RV20k	=	0.0178           ;;  20k Top Metal resistor 
    RV30k	=	0.00897          ;;  30k top Metal resistor 
    RV33k	=	0.0054           ;;  33k top Metal Cu resistor 
    RV40k	=	0.007            ;;  40k top Metal resistor 
    MIMCAP_CA		=	1.025E-3         ;;  MIMCAP area capacitance 
    MIMCAP_CF		=	2.425E-10        ;;  MIMCAP fringe capacitance 
    MIMCAP_1P5_CA	=	1.475E-3         ;;  MIMCAP_1P5 area capacitance 
    MIMCAP_1P5_CF	=	1.545E-10        ;;  MIMCAP_1P5 fringe capacitance
    MIMCAP_2P0_CA	=	1.955E-3         ;;  MIMCAP_2P0 area capacitance
    MIMCAP_2P0_CF	=	2.700E-10        ;;  MIMCAP_2P0 fringe capacitance
;;  END SETTING

;;***********************************************************************************
;;***!!! NOTICE !!!***
;;***********************************************************************************
;;    This LVS file, named as "LVS sheet resistance file", only contains the 
;; sheet resistance table which is corresponding to the sheet resistance value
;; specified in the spice model document. Please be aware of that this lvs file
;; can't be ran alone, otherwise you will get a syntax error message! 
;;    Another LVS rule file which is called the "LVS main deck" contains all
;; the LVS devices extraction, circuit comparsion and connectivity extraction
;; coding and also need the "LVS sheet restance file" for sheet resistance
;; reference.
;;    To obtain a complete LVS deck, you need to finish the following procedures.
;;
;; Procedures:
;;
;; 1. Please download the most update "LVS main deck" from TSMC-online system.
;;    Currently, the "LVS main deck" is packed together with the "LVS sheet 
;;    resistance file" in TSMC 0.18um Mixed Signal SALICIDE (1.8V/5V) with GPII-A
;;    process (Doc. T-018-CM-SP-012-U1). This LVS main deck support all devices
;;    from 0.18um LO/MM/MMRF/FLASH/CIS/HV/BCD processes.
;;
;; 2. Starting to unpack the compressed file (from step 1) and move this LVS
;;    sheet resistance file to folder RES_TALBE 
;;
;; 3. Execute the LVS install program LVS_install.pl (from unpacked directory)
;;    and choose the SPICE model and metalization option of your chip step by
;;    step, as the result, LVS files will be generated in MAIN_DECK folder
;;
;;    SPECIAL NOTICE:
;;
;;      1. Though the "LVS main deck" contains all the devices for TSMC 0.18 um
;;         processes, it dosen't mean that you can use all the deivces in your design.
;;         For what kind of devices that can be used, please refered to the Spice
;;         Model Card corresponded to your process.
;;
;;/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
;;
;;                          CHANGE HISTORY
;; 
;;    Date      version    who                         Description 
;; ---------- ---------- ------- ----------------------------------------------------------
; 09/03/2007   1.0a  Karena Lin   1) Based on BSIM 4.5 spice model, generate    
;                                    1p3m-1p6m Assura LVS command files. ;  
;  
; 10/01/2008   1.1a  Hank Lii     1) Added mismatch models for 1.8V BJTs  
;                                 2) Revise BJT definition to exclude dnw diode  
;                                 3) Prevent formation of OD and poly resistors due to OD and poly fill 
;                                   
; 12/22/2008   1.1b  Hank Lii     1) Remove DNW restriction from p+/nw and n+/pw diodes 
;                                 2) Remove DNW restriction from MVT NMOS 
;                                 3) Add Transfer Property command to resistors, mosfets, capacitors for mismatchflag 
; 
; 11/20/2009   v1.1c  T.M. Wu	 1) Add VDDM/VSSM in power/ground names 
;				 2) crtmom is using cell blocking 
;				 3) Revise crtmom's logic operations and properties calculations. 
;				 4) Revise metal interconnect logic operation : not exclude MOMDMY 
;				 5) Revise Nwell resistors' logic operations. 
;				 6) Revise 2T/3T mimcaps' logic operations and use ctm layer for mimcap's PLUS pin. 
;				 7) Revise mimcap, R[PR] and R[NR] formations 
;				 8) Metal datatypes are not limited to 0.  
;				 9) Support bb 3T mimcap's bulk terminal in NWELL. 
;				 10) mnpg and mpgg ERC check include all mos, but exclude rf mos.  
;				 11) Base band mos in RFDUMMY1 could be extracted in netlist. 
;				 12) BJT doesn't extract area : add paramsNotPassToQRC( BJT "area" ) in compare.rul. 
;				 13) Update LVS.rsf : Add following switches, please see detail switch descriptions 
;						      in LVS.rsf or TSMC_DOC_WM.  
;				    1. Add 5 ERC check switches : WELL_TO_PG_CHECK, GATE_TO_PG_CHECK, DS_TO_PG_CHECK 
;                                                                  FLOATING_WELL_CHECK and FLOATING_GATE_CHECK. 
; 
;				    2.Add a switch "OD_RES_WO_DMNP2V" : Default is off.  
;				       This switch is for 2T/3T non-silicide OD resistor. 
;				       If turn off it, 2T/3T non-silicide P+ OD resistors should w/i DMP2V.  
;				                       2T/3T non-silicide N+ OD resistors should w/i DMN2V. 
;				    3. Add switch "ZERO_NRDS", "FILTER_DGS_TIED_MOS", "NW_RING", "Skip_Soft_Connect_Checks", 
;						"spice_extraction". 
;				 14) Use wpe search distance layer "OD2" for I/O pmos.
; 01/28/2013   1.2a   X.M.Tu     Official release
;                                1) Create resister table for all-in-one deck

;;
