;  
;   Date     version   Who                      Description 
; ---------- ------- --------- ---------------------------------------------------------- 
;   Date      version      Who                      Description  
; ---------- ---------- --------- ----------------------------------------------------------  
; 06/04/2009    1.0a   tmwub      1) New deck 
; 
; 12/30/2010    1.3a   X.M.Tu     1) Update follow SPICE model v1.3    
;                                    Add new device:  
;                                    NPN10_5_RPO NPN2_5_RPO NPN5_5_RPO PNP10_5_RPO PNP2_5_RPO  
;						            NP5_5_RPO NDIO_5M PDIO_5M MENCH5 MEPCH5 CFMOM CFMOM_MX  
;					                MENCH5_DNW_6T MENCH5_MAC MENCH_DNW_6T MEPCH5_5T MEPCH5_DNW_5T  
;					                MEPCH5_MAC MEPCH_5T MEPCH_DNW_5T NCH_5_DNW_6T NCH_DNW_6T  
;						            NDIO_SBD_MAC NPN10_5_RPO_MIS NPN2_5_RPO_MIS NPN5_5_RPO_MIS  
;						            PCH_5_5T PCH_5_DNW_5T PCH_5T PCH_DNW_5T PNP10_5_RPO_MIS   
;						            PNP2_5_RPO_MIS PNP5_5_RPO_MIS RNODRPO_PURE5V   
;				                    RNODRPO_PURE5V_M RNPO1RPO_PURE5V RNPO1RPO_PURE5V_DIS   
;						            RNWOD_PURE5V RNWOD_PURE5V_M RNWSTI_PURE5V RNWSTI_PURE5V_M  
;					                RPODRPO_PURE5V RPODRPO_PURE5V_M RPODRPO_PURE5V   
;						            RPPO1RPO_PURE5V_DIS RPPOLYHRI3K RPPOLYHRI3K_DIS EFUSE  
;						         2) Add VDDM/VSSM in power/ground names   
;						         3) Option changes: "LVS REDUCE SPLIT GATES" is set to "NO".    
;					             4) Revise metal interconnects' logic operations   
;  				                 5) Revise 2t/3t mimcaps' logic operations and using ctm layer for 2t/3t 
;                                    mimcaps' PLUS pins 
;					             6) Revise crtmom's logic operations and property calculations.    
;					             7) Add core parasitic nw-psub diode pnwdio,   model name is nwdio.   
;					                Add I/O  parasitic nw-psub diode pnwdio_5, model name is nwdio_5.    
;                                    Note: For NW touches 2 or more psub, parasitic nwdio and nwdio_5   
;						            won't be extracted.Using "extract_parasitic_diodes" switch to   
;						            extract it. Default switch is turn off.   
;					                These 2 parasitic diodes are filtered (not compared) in LVS.   
;					             8) Remove switch "extract_dnwdio", and using "extract_parasitic_diodes"   
;						            switch to extract dnwpsub, pwdnw and pwdnw_5 these 3 parasitic diodes.   
;						            Default switch is turn off.   
;					                These 3 parasitic diodes are also filtered (not compared) in LVS.    
;					                Note: This is not compatible in GPIIA v1.0a   
;					             9) Extract pj parameter for dnwpsub.   
;					             10) Following DRM, rnodrpo_m should w/i DMN2V and rpodrpo_m should w/i DMP2V.  
;					             11) Support 3t mimcap's bulk terminal in NWELL.   
;					             12) Revise R[PD] formation : should w/i DMP2V   
;					                 Revise R[ND] formation : should w/i DMN2V   
;					                 Revise rpodrpo_m formation : should w/i DMP2V   
;					                 Revise rnodrpo_m formation : should w/i DMN2V   
;					             13) Revise I/O pmos WPE effect : using OD2 search distance layer for I/O pmos  
;						         14) We don't suggest customer to use 4T MOS(w/o 182;5 dummy layer) w/i   
;                                     parasitic diodes as full terminal isolated MOS. 
;                                 15) Revise Pj calculation of NW/PSUB diodes. 
;                                 16) Add new layer:    
;                                     RWDMY5(52,5) --> dummy layer to form PURE 5V N-Well resistor 
;                                     RPDMY5(54,5) --> dummy layer to form PURE 5V OD/POLY resistor 
; 
; 10/31/2011    1.4a    L.Fu      1) Official release for T-018-CM-SP-012 v1.4 model 
;                                 2) Support 20k/33k/40k top metal thinkness LVS deck 
;                                 3) Remove 5t/6t LV MOS devices follow model change:  
;                                    pch_5t, pch_dnw_5t, pch_5_5t, pch_5_dnw_5t	   
;                                    mepch_5t, mepch_dnw_5t, mepch5_5t, mepch5_dnw_5t 
;                                    mench5_dnw_6t, mench_dnw_6t nch_5_dnw_6t, nch_dnw_6t 
;                                 4) Designate T-018-CM-SP-012-U1 v1.4a as 0.18um All-In-One ASSURA LVS/LPE main_deck 
;                                    This main deck support for all 0.18um LO/MM/MMRF/FLASH/CIS/HV/BCD processes 
;                                    All of SPICE model devices from 0.18um LO/MM/MMRF/FLASH/CIS/HV/BCD processes 
;                                    would be provided in this main deck 
;                                 5) Add a switch "top2_thick", default is off, if turn on, double UTM would be provided 
;                                    Following DRM, "top2_thick" is only supported by thickness 33k, 1P5M & 1P6M deck 
;                                 6) Add a switch "Cu_RDL", default is off, if turn on, copper RDL would be provided 
;                                    Following DRM, switch "Cu_RDL" is only supported by thickness 8k(nonUTM) 
;                                 7) Add new layer "AP_Cu" for PPI connection in thickness 8k(nonUTM) and 30k 
;                                 8) Change default setting of switch "extract_parasitic_diodes" to turn off 
;                                 9) Add a switch "compare_parasitic_diodes", default is off, turn on to apply the 
;                                    comparison of parasitic diodes 
;                                 10) Add switch PROCESS_WI_PURE5V_RES to support different logic operation of OD2 layer 
;                                     for non-PURE5V OD/POLY resistor w/o silicide & NWELL resistor  
;                                 11) Add switch PROCESS_WO_MVTMOS_MACRO to exclude MVT MOS macro model devices from  
;                                     FLASH processes 
;                                 12) Remove WPE property from nativ MOS 
;                                 13) Waive HVNW/HVPW of LDMOS drain from ERC floating WELL check 
;                                 14) Revise device M[ND] & M[nch5_lvt] logic opeartion: don't care MTP_2T2C; 
;                                 15) Revise ERC layer n_psub & n_pplug logic operation to fix rw softconnect issues; 
;  
; 02/10/2012    1.4b_pre021012    L.Fu      1) Add new devices: nvmrpodrpo, nvmrpodrpo_m 
;                                           2) ERC floating well check enhancement for tool performance improvement 
;  
; 04/03/2012    1.4b    X.M.Tu      Official release 
;                                 1) Add new devices: nch_hvish_nbl_mac, hvpwdio_hv_iso, nbldio_hv_iso 
;				 2) Modify logic operaction to don't care DNW when extract NA(mench/mench_mac) and NB(mench3/mench3_mac/mench5/mench5_mac) 
;04/13/2012     1.4c_pre041612    X.M.Tu   1) Add  parasitic diode GUI model name to compareParameter in compare.rul to make switch "compare_parasitic_diodes" enable in GUI model 
;09/21/2012     1.4c              X.M.Tu   Official release 
;                                          1) Add T-018-CM-SP-027 v0.1 devices 
;					  2) Modify n_psub & n_pplug connection for sconnect check . 
;					  3) Fix the nxwell and NBL connection, In HV32V ,the NW and NBL will not connect with each other. 
;					  4) Support 3T mimcap 3rd terminal inside HVNW/HVPW 
;01/28/2013     1.4d               X.M.Tu  Official release 
